with the release of 2021's eternals the  marvel superhero known as ajak will  finally be coming to the silver screen  as portrayed by salma hayek but who  exactly is ajax and why is the character  so important to the eternals this is  ajax story explained  although they haven't always been at the  forefront of most fans minds the  eternals cast a huge shadow over the  history of the marvel universe those  mutations that make the x-men so uncanny  they're tied to the eternal's origin  thanos he's involved with them too in a  roundabout way the eternals once  colonized a little place called titan  which became home to thanos centuries  later i am  inevitable  the eternals are essentially the product  of experimentation performed by an  ancient omnipotent group of super-sized  humanoids called the celestials the  celestials tinkered with humanity's  genetic code creating two offshoot races  the grotesque creatures known as the  deviants and the immortal super-powered  beings that make up the eternals despite  looking like humans the eternals are  very nearly divine in their abilities  they can control the aging process cast  illusions fly read minds and transform  matter essentially they are gods and  have often ended up becoming the source  of many of humanity's legends religions  and fables for example the eternal  cersei was immortalized as cersei and  homer's odyssey while icarus's life  inspired the ancient tale of icarus  like his fellow eternals ajak has a rich  backstory of his own however to fully  understand who he is it's important to  understand what he can do ajac is  equipped with superhuman strength for  one he can also fly at speed teleport  and do almost everything that falls  under the general category of energy  manipulation when it comes time to throw  down against the bad guys he's capable  of projecting beams of heat and  concussive energy from his eyes and  hands he is also a brilliant  archaeologist perhaps helped by the fact  that he was around for much of the  history he digs up in some of the latest  eternal stories ajac has also been shown  to have the power to change gender  although it's uncertain how much of this  constitutes a retcon uniquely ajax  possesses an uncanny ability to  communicate with the celestials this is  pretty much his signature ability when  it comes to protecting humanity as few  other eternals are able to do it and  given that the celestials have a habit  of showing up every now and again to see  if they feel like destroying the earth  it's fair to say that ajax's powers are  pretty vital to the team  ajax was born in the eternal city of  paleria located in the ural mountains to  parents named raqqar and amma his branch  of the species is sometimes referred to  as the polar eternals not much is known  about ajac prior to the celestial's  intervention in his life but it is known  that ajax and his brother arax were  active in ancient greece around 1200 bc  or the former was mistaken for the  mythical hero of the trojan war ajax  unfortunately there's very little  information about what happened to arex  after the brother's time in greece came  to an end he pops up only very rarely in  the marvel canon and the jury is out as  to whether or not he's even still alive  after greece ajax wandered the earth  making his way to places such as babylon  where he took on the deviant leader  warlord crow  after that he spent some time in the  americas where he was worshiped as a god  the aztecs paid tribute to him as  quetzalcoatl one of the wisest and most  powerful of their deities in time the  incas also came to worship ajak as teku  mozan the lord of flight and ajak wasn't  shy about using his supreme power to  advance the civilizations he favored by  1000 ad ajak was an accomplished warrior  cosmic genius and influential figure in  the progress of humanity well that would  be enough for most superheroes to hang  their hats on however ajax's greatest  feats yet would come with the return of  the celestials  unable to escape his own past ajac  crossed pass with both the celestials  and the deviants once again when the  former returned to earth on a  fact-finding mission this is because  earth wasn't the only planet the  celestials decided to experiment on the  home worlds of races such as the skrulls  and the cree got the same treatment for  example to help judge whether or not  they had been a success the celestial  subjected each race to four tests or  hosts to deem them worthy of life during  the third host ajax was living in peru  he acted as a liaison between the  celestials and humanity as well as a  go-between for the celestials and the  gods humanity had given rise to such as  zeus of the greek pantheon luckily  humanity passed the test with flying  colors and ajax decided to put his atoms  into storage until the celestials  returned  eventually the fourth host of celestials  returned to earth to see how their  experiments were faring kicking off  ajax's story in the modern marvel  universe ajak is awoken by icarus in  1976 eternals number two soon after the  celestials once again come to south  america and settle on an incan plateau  that ajax had set up for them and once  again he acts as their liaison this time  however their presence sparks  intervention from the likes of shield as  well as odin and the forces of asgard  because that's what heroes do despite  the combined efforts of all three  factions earth ends up losing the fight  against the celestials however the  battle helps the celestials realize that  humanity is worthy and therefore they  agree to let the earth off the hook most  of the important players have their  memories erased to the whole incident  and the eternals realize they needn't  worry about the celestial's  interventions anymore so it's good news  all around but it also means that ajax  is out of a job  during the fourth post event ajax  befriends a human archaeologist named dr  daniel damian after icarus brings a  brilliant doctor along to awaken ajax  the two become thick as thieves damien  even watches the fourth post event take  place from within the celestial's  impenetrable dome however he is more  interested in preserving the history of  the incas than he is in making sure  humanity passes its test  damien begins with all the makings of a  classic superhero ally but grief does  horrible things to people his daughter  margot flees the celestial city with  icarus while damian agrees to stay  behind to protect history icarus and  margot are separated and she is later  turned into a deviant and killed in an  attempt to get to icarus in the wake of  this tragedy damian seeks revenge on  celestials deviant's eternals a lot of  them part of his plan includes an  elaborate trick against the eternals and  deviants specifically he turns ajak into  a literal monster needless to say  damian's relationship with the eternal  sours and his friendship with ajax dies  a miserable death  damien's plan involves planting false  prophecies about the twin offspring of  eternals and deviants being the ones to  eventually conquer both races he then  uses advanced celestial technology to  transform ajak into a monster whose sole  purpose seems to be systematically  hunting down and killing twin siblings  on earth thus mutated ajak assists in  the kidnapping of twins donald and  deborah ritter the offspring of the  eternal athena and the deviant crow  fortunately the doctor's plan to kill  the twins in front of their parents  fails when icarus gets wise to the whole  situation and disgusted with his own  actions ajax disintegrates both himself  and damien  luckily this all happens in the world of  comic books where death is merely a  distraction ajac is eventually  resurrected in the chambers of the  eternal city of olympia by an eternal  named sprite sprite is later revealed to  be deceiving ajac in the other eternals  into helping him use the power of the  fabled dreaming celestial to overwrite  reality sprite's plot is thwarted but it  leads to an enduring rivalry between  ajac and another eternal one that would  result in his second death and  resurrection  when the dreaming celestial is awoken it  chooses the eternal makari as its  spokesperson obviously ajax's experience  in this field is extensive so he  understandably feels a little slighted  by this choice and soon grows to hate  makari he even hatches a plan to kill  him but while makari does die it doesn't  stick now at loose ends ajax decides to  travel the world and learn as much as he  can about the celestials he lives in san  francisco for a time and even becomes a  gardener this journey eventually leads  ajax to join hercules in a battle with  the scroll gods in which he squares off  with a divine scroll named kleiben it's  during this fight that ajax dies again  again this being the marvel universe  ajax's death doesn't last he returns to  earth and travels to olympia where he  lives among his fellow eternals however  all this changes the day dead celestials  reign from the sky signaling the arrival  of the dark celestials on earth that's  when the eternals learn a terrible  secret about themselves and their  existence one that leads all of them to  either turn on each other or kill  themselves of course once again they've  all been revived ajax stars as a woman  alongside makari in the 2021 eternal  celestia one shot  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite marvel comics characters  are coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

